From e2a8995e61a64aae8de0a8e7a2d74be008024d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:28:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] Seer: a new rounded default theme for the whole UI

Adds the Seer theme (near-black floating surfaces, pill controls, gradient
headers, a blurred player bar) and makes it the default. Browsers still on
the old Dark default switch once; later choices are kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

